## Task Dependencies Graph

```
TASK-001 to TASK-008: Migrations (parallel)
    ↓
TASK-009: Run migrations
    ↓
TASK-010, TASK-011: Models
    ↓
TASK-012: Event Publisher
    ↓
TASK-013 to TASK-022: Task Service endpoints (can run in parallel)

TASK-023 to TASK-031: Recurrence Service (sequential)
TASK-032 to TASK-038: Reminder Service (sequential)

TASK-039 to TASK-043: MCP tools (depend on backend endpoints)
TASK-044 to TASK-050: Frontend components (depend on backend endpoints)

TASK-051 to TASK-053: Kafka setup (sequential)
TASK-054 to TASK-059: Dapr setup (sequential, depends on TASK-053 for pubsub)
TASK-060 to TASK-066: K8s deployments (parallel, depend on TASK-054)

TASK-067 to TASK-071: Testing (depend on respective features)
TASK-072 to TASK-075: CI/CD (sequential)
```

