## Implementation Order

**Week 1:** TASK-001 to TASK-022 (Database + Task Service)
**Week 2:** TASK-023 to TASK-038 (New Services)
**Week 3:** TASK-039 to TASK-050 (MCP + Frontend)
**Week 4:** TASK-051 to TASK-066 (Infrastructure)
**Week 5:** TASK-067 to TASK-071 (Testing)
**Week 6:** TASK-072 to TASK-075 (CI/CD + Deployment)

